# comment 0010cdd0 Per-frame sound bank state machine (6 slots x 17 words at sSndcomWork): loads hd/bd/sq files from tbl_H_Sndcom_BankFiles, stages them in IOP RAM (sceSifAllocSysMemory + H_Sndcom_CopyToIop), uploads bodies to SPU2 with sceSkSsSOUND_Send(1,iop,spu,n) in 4096/65536-byte chunks, then HSYNTH_Bind/SESQ_Bind. ev: 12 s2.3
# comment 0010c7d0 Resource-manager worker thread: SleepThread until control->go; dispatches request kinds 0-9 (RpWorldStreamRead, RpClumpStreamRead, RwTexDictionaryStreamRead, RwStreamRead, ...), destroys the CDVD request, marks done (state 3) and chains to the next request. ev: 12 s4.1
